<title>USA: Mississippi View Holding Co Q2 net up.</title>
<headline>Mississippi View Holding Co Q2 net up.</headline>
<dateline>LITTLE FALLS, Minn. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended March 31,  Six Months Ended March 31,</p>
<p>				1997	1996	 1997	 1996</p>
<p>Interest Income  $1,284,822 $1,299,659 $2,577,759 $2,606,457  Interest Expense    621,052    636,762  1,255,347  1,258,842</p>
<p> Noninterest Income   40,515     53,591     78,032    212,210</p>
<p> Noninterest Expense 398,865    417,782    837,685    829,692</p>
<p> Income Before Taxes 305,420    298,706    562,759    730,133</p>
<p> NET INCOME	    173,862    173,570    347,127    431,178</p>
<p>Earnings Per Share (a)</p>
<p>				0.22	 0.19	 O.43	 O.48</p>
<p>    (a)    Earnings per share is based on the weighted average</p>
<p>number of shares of common stock and common stock equivalents outstanding for the period. The weighted average number of shares of common stock and common stock equivalents outstanding at March 31, 1997, was reduced as a result of the repurchase of common stock.</p>
<p>    (b)   At March 31, 1997 shares outstanding were 818,743</p>
<p>versus 957,593 at March 31, 1996.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
